OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize 57 fireworks in
OL,4,ABonfire Night crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 57 fireworks were seized by
OL,7,Fofficers during a police operation
OL,8,Facross Nottinghamshire on Bonfire
OL,9,FNight.
OL,11,FMore than 20 of them were seized in a
OL,12,Fcar park near the Forest Recreation
OL,13,FGround in Nottingham after a firework
OL,14,Fwas set off illegally, Nottinghamshire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,F"Those responsible were given words of
OL,18,Fadvice before being dispersed from the
OL,19,Farea," the force added in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
