OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize 57 fireworks in
OL,4,ABonfire Night crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven dispersal orders were in place
OL,7,Facross the county on Thursday night,
OL,8,Fwith the operation organised to address
OL,9,Fconcerns over the anti-social use of
OL,10,Ffireworks, police said.
